{"3092660":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Reverse: 1999","steam_appid":3092660,"required_age":0,"is_free":true,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3092660\/extras\/59b164a0ffebc6c3baf87e64940f5193.poster.avif?t=1793884285\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3092660\/extras\/59b164a0ffebc6c3baf87e64940f5193.webm?t=1793884285\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3092660\/extras\/59b164a0ffebc6c3baf87e64940f5193.mp4?t=1793884285\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the last day of 1999, the &quot;Storm&quot; fell upon the world. You witnessed an era reversed beneath the rising raindrops. Defying all reasons, what unfolds in front of you is the world of an era long past. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the Timekeeper, observer of eras, you are free to travel through these eras after each &quot;Storm.&quot; With the aid of Sonetto, a powerful Arcanist and ally from the Foundation, your mission is to travel through eras to where the &quot;Storm&quot; is most active, find other Arcanists who can sense the coming &quot;Storm,&quot; and save them from being &quot;sifted out&quot; of the timeline. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >▶▶Stunning Visuals Blending Retro and Modern Aesthetics◀◀ <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the mysterious alt-history animated by unique visual elements that blend Pop Art, classical oil painting, and more art styles in history.  <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >▶▶A Cinematic Adventure across the 20th Century◀◀  <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the Roaring '20s to the turn of the millennium, you will embark on a journey across time and space, and uncover the truth about the &quot;Storm&quot; and the mystery of the year 1999. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >▶▶Full English Voice Acting with Authentic Accents◀◀  <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in ages past. Enjoy a story performed by diverse cast of voice actors with British, Italian, French, and other accents.  <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >▶▶Fantastic Arcanists from Different Times and Regions◀◀ <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >People once called them &quot;mages,&quot; &quot;wizards,&quot; and &quot;freaks.&quot; Now they live in uneasy coexistence with regular humans … But who are the Arcanists, really? <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >▶▶Weave Arcane Incantations to Attain Glorious Victories◀◀ <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your team, cast spells, and use gorgeous arcane skills to defeat your enemies. Begin your exciting adventure through time in this all-new RPG.<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3092660\/extras\/59b164a0ffebc6c3baf87e64940f5193.poster.avif?t=1793884285\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3092660\/extras\/59b164a0ffebc6c3baf87e64940f5193.webm?t=1793884285\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3092660\/extras\/59b164a0ffebc6c3baf87e64940f5193.mp4?t=1793884285\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the last day of 1999, the &quot;Storm&quot; fell upon the world. You witnessed an era reversed beneath the rising raindrops. Defying all reasons, what unfolds in front of you is the world of an era long past. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the Timekeeper, observer of eras, you are free to travel through these eras after each &quot;Storm.&quot; With the aid of Sonetto, a powerful Arcanist and ally from the Foundation, your mission is to travel through eras to where the &quot;Storm&quot; is most active, find other Arcanists who can sense the coming &quot;Storm,&quot; and save them from being &quot;sifted out&quot; of the timeline. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >▶▶Stunning Visuals Blending Retro and Modern Aesthetics◀◀ <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the mysterious alt-history animated by unique visual elements that blend Pop Art, classical oil painting, and more art styles in history.  <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >▶▶A Cinematic Adventure across the 20th Century◀◀  <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the Roaring '20s to the turn of the millennium, you will embark on a journey across time and space, and uncover the truth about the &quot;Storm&quot; and the mystery of the year 1999. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >▶▶Full English Voice Acting with Authentic Accents◀◀  <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in ages past. Enjoy a story performed by diverse cast of voice actors with British, Italian, French, and other accents.  <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >▶▶Fantastic Arcanists from Different Times and Regions◀◀ <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >People once called them &quot;mages,&quot; &quot;wizards,&quot; and &quot;freaks.&quot; Now they live in uneasy coexistence with regular humans … But who are the Arcanists, really? <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >▶▶Weave Arcane Incantations to Attain Glorious Victories◀◀ <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your team, cast spells, and use gorgeous arcane skills to defeat your enemies. Begin your exciting adventure through time in this all-new RPG.<\/p>","short_description":"Reverse: 1999 is a 20th Century Time-Travel Strategic RPG developed by Bluepoch. As the Timekeeper, the observer of eras, you will embark on a journey across time and space, from the Roaring '20s to the turn of the millennium, uncovering the truth about the &quot;Storm&quot; and the mystery of the year 1999.","supported_languages":"English<strong>*<\/strong>, Japanese<strong>*<\/strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*<\/strong>, Traditional Chinese, Korean<strong>*<\/strong><br><strong>*<\/strong>languages with full audio support","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3092660\/5672d9bc2a19daca28b4a52614eb7939f170ff3e\/header.jpg?t=1793884285","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3092660\/b797062565af0cbb69ba964836522ad19d8ca7d2\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793884285","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3092660\/b797062565af0cbb69ba964836522ad19d8ca7d2\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793884285","website":"https:\/\/re1999.bluepoch.com\/","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-2300<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050 2GB<br><\/li><li><strong>Network:<\/strong> Broadband Internet connection<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 20 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"linux_requirements":[],"developers":["BLUEPOCH GAMES CO., LIMITED"],"publishers":["BLUEPOCH GAMES CO., LIMITED"],"package_groups":[],"platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":false},"categories":[{"id":2,"description":"Single-player"},{"id":13,"description":"Captions available"},{"id":35,"description":"In-App Purchases"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"}],"genres":[{"id":"3","description":"RPG"},{"id":"37","description":"Free To Play"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3092660\/8899eb7fd45d